# Credentials from a .netrc, against the one subtree of the test server
# that requires them.  The password holds an apostrophe: stripping one
# is upstream issue #75, and the reporter's generated password worked
# with every other WebDAV client.  If the parser mangles it, everything
# here fails with 401.
lcd @WORK@
put hello.txt
ls
delete hello.txt
ls
quit
